00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:51.020
it's 'Never stop trying new things.'

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.120
like, no matter what you're doing

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.160
even if you're going to college

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.680
or if you're going straight into work

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:55.820
or whatever you're doing

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.020
